he perfect balance of serene waterfront living and vibrant city life.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1341,"cta":{"id":2110,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Jumeirah_Asora_Bay_by_Meraas_at_La_Mer_Jumeirah_Dubai_a5c7943eb4.jpg","hash":"Jumeirah_Asora_Bay_by_Meraas_at_La_Mer_Jumeirah_Dubai_a5c7943eb4","name":"Jumeirah Asora Bay by Meraas at La Mer Jumeirah Dubai"},"style":null,"title":"A Seaside Haven in La Mer, Jumeirah, Dubai","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Nestled in the heart of La Mer, Jumeirah, Jumeirah Asora Bay redefines coastal luxury. This vibrant seaside destination seamlessly blends modern refinement with natural beauty, offering pristine sandy beaches, boutique shopping, and world-class dining. Situated within one of Dubai's most iconic neighborhoods, residents enjoy unmatched connectivity to the city's landmarks, including Burj Khalifa, Downtown Dubai, and Palm Jumeirah, all within minutes. With its serene ambiance and elevated lifestyle, La Mer is more than a location—it's a vibrant escape where city living meets oceanfront tranquility.</p><ul><li>J1 Beach – 4 minutes</li><li>City Walk – 9 minutes</li><li>Dubai Mall – 10 minutes</li><li>Bvlgari Resort Dubai – 10 minutes</li><li>Jumeirah Beach – 13 minutes</li><li>Burj Khalifa – 11 minutes</li><li>Dubai International Airport – 17 minutes</li><li>Mall of the Emirates – 18 minutes</li><li>Burj Al-Arab – 21 minutes</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":3617,"url":null,"file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Brochure_7add1a519b.pdf","hash":"Brochure_7add1a519b","name":"Brochure"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d